I'll write a binary search solution that finds the single element in a sorted array where every other element appears exactly twice.
TOOL {"ticket_id": "T-1", "code": "def search(nums):
    lo, hi = 0, len(nums) - 1
    while lo < hi:
        mid = (lo + hi) // 2
        # ensure mid is even-aligned pair check
        if mid % 2 == 1:
            mid -= 1
        if nums[mid] == nums[mid + 1]:
            lo = mid + 2
        else:
            hi = mid
    return nums[lo]
"}

