The task: count characters whose position (1-indexed) in the string equals their position in the alphabet (case-insensitive).

Check "xbcefg": x at pos1 (alphabet 24) no; b at pos2 (2) yes; c at pos3 (3) yes; e at pos4 (5) no; f at pos5 (6) no; g at pos6 (7) no. Count = 2. Matches.
